{"4652800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cake Studio", "steam_appid": 4652800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/218bc267e926264da74a3de39c289511.poster.avif?t=1786209793\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/218bc267e926264da74a3de39c289511.webm?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/218bc267e926264da74a3de39c289511.mp4?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cake Studio gives you the tools to design beautiful, vintage-style cakes without destroying your kitchen. This is a pure stress-free sandbox experience with no objectives, so forget about completing orders in time or dealing with angry customers. Let your creativity run free and create the cake of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Cake</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an extensive catalog of piping and decor options to make your cake as elaborate as your heart desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/1bee29aed8767d639862f328812d3842.poster.avif?t=1786209793\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/1bee29aed8767d639862f328812d3842.webm?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/1bee29aed8767d639862f328812d3842.mp4?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set the Scene</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your cake stand and background to perfectly complement your beautiful creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/e9e2a970a7fdf1fdf84c0c29c4b40c9e.poster.avif?t=1786209793\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/e9e2a970a7fdf1fdf84c0c29c4b40c9e.webm?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/e9e2a970a7fdf1fdf84c0c29c4b40c9e.mp4?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to Come!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens more decorations and piping styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional piping functionality, including free drawing and piped text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More cake shapes — heart, square, rectangle, oval, star</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable scenes including setting, surface, and props</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode with lighting and camera options and export for social media sharing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily creative prompts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shareable cake galleries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/218bc267e926264da74a3de39c289511.poster.avif?t=1786209793\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/218bc267e926264da74a3de39c289511.webm?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/218bc267e926264da74a3de39c289511.mp4?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cake Studio gives you the tools to design beautiful, vintage-style cakes without destroying your kitchen. This is a pure stress-free sandbox experience with no objectives, so forget about completing orders in time or dealing with angry customers. Let your creativity run free and create the cake of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Cake</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an extensive catalog of piping and decor options to make your cake as elaborate as your heart desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/1bee29aed8767d639862f328812d3842.poster.avif?t=1786209793\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/1bee29aed8767d639862f328812d3842.webm?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/1bee29aed8767d639862f328812d3842.mp4?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set the Scene</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your cake stand and background to perfectly complement your beautiful creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/e9e2a970a7fdf1fdf84c0c29c4b40c9e.poster.avif?t=1786209793\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/e9e2a970a7fdf1fdf84c0c29c4b40c9e.webm?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/extras/e9e2a970a7fdf1fdf84c0c29c4b40c9e.mp4?t=1786209793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to Come!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens more decorations and piping styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional piping functionality, including free drawing and piped text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More cake shapes — heart, square, rectangle, oval, star</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable scenes including setting, surface, and props</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode with lighting and camera options and export for social media sharing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily creative prompts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shareable cake galleries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Create the cake of your dreams in this cozy cake-decorating sandbox game. No objectives or timers, just relaxing creative bliss!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/d3bbc9828a775932745519ceeda7669167d0c34e/header.jpg?t=1786209793", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/cce661f0bbdb8b02ccfe84a4474be6784199d7a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786209793", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4652800/cce661f0bbdb8b02ccfe84a4474be6784199d7a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786209793", "website": "https://longlost.studio", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><st